plaintext
* Netlist for the given circuit

* PMOS Transistors
* Format: M<Name> <Drain> <Gate> <Source> <Body> <Model>
M1 3 6 0 0 PMOS
M2 3 5 0 0 PMOS

* Current Source
* Format: I<Name> <Positive Node> <Negative Node> <Value>
I1 3 0 DC

* Capacitor
* Format: C<Name> <Positive Node> <Negative Node> <Capacitance>
C1 3 2 <Capacitance_Value>

* Voltage Source
* Format: V<Name> <Positive Node> <Negative Node> <Voltage>
Vt 2 4 <Voltage_Value>

* Models (these need to be defined appropriately; here are placeholders)
.model PMOS PMOS(level=1)